<h1>Lesson 2: Computational Thinking</h1>
<div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #E4E2F8; color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Aligns to curriculum Lessons 2-3</div>
<p>This lesson prepares you to teach two curriculum lessons:</p>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<p><b>Curriculum Lesson 2:</b> Computational Thinking</p>
<a href="[LESSON 2 URL]" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 2</a>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
<p><b>Curriculum Lesson 3:</b> Designing Algorithms</p>
<a href="[LESSON 3 URL]" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 3</a>
</div>
<hr>
<p><b>In this lesson, you'll:</b></p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Explore decomposition and abstraction as computational thinking pillars</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• See how students apply these pillars to a real problem solving activity</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Preview how algorithms get broken into steps and visualized as flowcharts</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Connect algorithmic decision making to real world AI applications like content moderation</p>
<div style="background-color: #E4E2F8; color: #222222; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
<p><b>💡 Notice as you explore: </b> the decomposition and abstraction pairing, how flowcharts make algorithm logic visible before code is written, and where the ethical implications of algorithmic decisions enter the conversation.</p>
</div>
<hr>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 24px; max-width: 700px;">
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #ACA8EA; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Lesson 1</div>
